%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: BBox clips the shading. An axial blend extended at both
% ends would fill its clip, but its BBox confines it to a smaller
% rectangle; the same shading as a pattern is confined the same way
% inside the rectangle it fills.
/Sh << /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB /Coords [100 0 300 0]
   /BBox [120 420 280 480]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0.2 0.6 0.2] /C1 [0.9 0.9 0.1] /N 1 >>
   /Extend [true true] >> def
gsave
50 400 300 100 rectclip
Sh shfill
grestore
gsave
0 -200 translate
/P << /PatternType 2 /Shading Sh >> matrix makepattern setpattern
50 400 300 100 rectfill
grestore
showpage
